# <type>(<scope>): <summary>
#
# Why:
# - Why is this change necessary?
#
# What:
# - What changed?
#
# Testing:
# - How was it verified?
#
# Types:
# feat     new behavior
# fix      bug fix
# refactor code change without behavior change
# perf     performance improvement
# test     test changes
# build    build/dependency/versioning changes
# ci       CI/CD changes
# docs     documentation
# chore    maintenance
#
# Common scopes:
# broker
# protocol
# storage
# producer
# consumer
# ci
# build
#
# Examples:
#
# feat(storage): add persistent append-only log
#
# Why:
# - Records disappeared after broker restart.
#
# What:
# - Add FileMessageStore.
# - Add binary record encoding.
# - Recover offsets from log files.
#
# Testing:
# - Add restart recovery integration tests.
#
# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Keep summary under ~72 characters when practical.
# Use imperative mood.
# Explain WHY, not only WHAT.
# ------------------------------------------------------------